<title>SOUTH KOREA: Asia Motors in $50 mln Yemen export deal.</title>
<headline>Asia Motors in $50 mln Yemen export deal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Asia Motors Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had agreed to export 500 military vehicles worth $50 million to Yemen's defence ministry.</p>
<p>A company statement said the 500 units were scheduled to be delivered in June.</p>
<p>The company said it also hoped to expand exports of civilian vehicles to Yemen.</p>
<p>--Seoul newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
